83	// polished gold, art-directed in DISPLAY colours measured on the approved picture (then pjInverse like the plate):
84	// groove (110,35,5) / shadow band (168,70,18) / mid (205,97,28) / lit (245,143,38) / hot lip (255,204,77) / glint.
